      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然现在这个时代已经不推崇英俊了，\n但我想要好好尊重这个店名。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713673B057288FD94E2A65F64EE35DF27ECF4E0D63A85D0782F14FCA4E86FF0C000A4F46621160F38981597D597D5C0A91CD8FD94E2A5E97540D300200100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀，话题扯远了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n能帮忙为客人送上\n厉害密阿雷格雷派饼的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n英俊宝可梦……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF0C8BDD9898626F8FDC4E86300200100001BE01000A80FD5E2E5FD94E3A5BA24EBA90014E0A000A53895BB35BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997C768400100001BE00000A82F14FCA5B9D53EF68A62026202600100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是英俊的爱管侍！\n请让给我一只吧！拜托了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F82F14FCA768472317BA14F8DFF01000A8BF78BA97ED962114E0053EA5427FF0162DC62584E86FF0100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你愿意把英俊的爱管侍让给我吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60613F610F628A82F14FCA768472317BA14F8D8BA97ED962115417FF1F00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "愿意！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "613F610FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哇哦！要是英俊的爱管侍来帮忙，\n简直是以一当百！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C754E6FF018981662F82F14FCA768472317BA14F8D67655E2E5FD9FF0C000A7B8076F4662F4EE54E005F53767EFF0100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请让给我一只\n英俊的爱管侍吧！拜托了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF78BA97ED962114E0053EA000A82F14FCA768472317BA14F8D5427FF0162DC62584E86FF0100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是能有只英俊的爱管侍……",
