      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，我这就来做超越密阿雷格雷派饼的\n厉害密阿雷格雷派饼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C62118FD95C316765505A8D858D8A5BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997C7684000A53895BB35BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997C300200100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就是！巨级密阿雷格雷派饼！\n没错！比超级还要厉害。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n真是英俊无比的创意和行动力！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C31662FFF015DE87EA75BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997CFF01000A6CA19519FF016BD48D857EA78FD8898153895BB3300200100001BE00000A771F662F82F14FCA65E06BD47684521B610F548C884C52A8529BFF0100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "爱管侍！请为客人送上\n刚出炉的巨级密阿雷格雷派饼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72317BA14F8DFF018BF74E3A5BA24EBA90014E0A000A521A51FA708976845DE87EA75BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997C300200100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀呀……太大了，\n都没地方放咖啡了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440544020262026592A59274E86FF0C000A90FD6CA1573065B9653E549655614E86300200100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来有点英俊过头了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B6765670970B982F14FCA8FC759344E86300200100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但我知道爱管侍有多么英俊了。\n这也算是个收获！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46621177E5905372317BA14F8D6709591A4E4882F14FCA4E863002000A8FD94E5F7B97662F4E2A653683B7FF0100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "侍嘶～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F8D5636FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "爱管侍！今后我们一起\n让英俊咖啡馆越来越红火吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
